{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Loot Shop Simulator</strong> \u2013 the cozy, fantasy shop sim where <i>you</i> open all of the loot boxes\u2026 and then resell the loot to your (extremely loyal) customers! Decorate your shop, hoard rare gear, and hustle cursed swords to adventurers on suspiciously personal quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/b919ca12b152b70534b8709e9db046b3.poster.avif?t=1750956969\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/b919ca12b152b70534b8709e9db046b3.webm?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/b919ca12b152b70534b8709e9db046b3.mp4?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crack Boxes, Get Rich</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a variety of loot boxes from totally legitimate, fantasy sets like <i>Legend of the NFT-Eyed, Lootbox Dragon</i> and <i>Wrath of the Witch King!</i>\u00a0Get swords, get sparkles, get mildly suspicious rings. Then sell them. For gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/042071f45f1cb56843c195ccea646971.poster.avif?t=1750956969\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/042071f45f1cb56843c195ccea646971.webm?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/042071f45f1cb56843c195ccea646971.mp4?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate for Vibes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want some cozy rugs? How about a completely unnecessary dragon statue? Your shop\u2019s charm brings in foot traffic\u2014and the occasional weirdo with a story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/c27b2ee5126fd0b57d18aab75c8476ce.poster.avif?t=1750956969\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/c27b2ee5126fd0b57d18aab75c8476ce.webm?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/c27b2ee5126fd0b57d18aab75c8476ce.mp4?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Good Stuff</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each loot set has its own wacky theme and shiny nonsense. From humble Irony Swords to legendary pray-to-win artifacts, stock your shelves with treasure and flex your rarest finds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/481e7e908efdf3486b8e9e63ca04ffd7.poster.avif?t=1750956969\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/481e7e908efdf3486b8e9e63ca04ffd7.webm?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644050/extras/481e7e908efdf3486b8e9e63ca04ffd7.mp4?t=1750956969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><